		},
		{
			"id":"14f94a00371f5c32",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Fire Command-AI",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2040,
			"y":1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"129d9cbdc0fb3291",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dyanimic",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":590,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7da7c43b986ff0fa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Details Got",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":647,
			"y":1060,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2b00ec77aef60981",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dynamically create a message",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":960,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4fe3442dd5c8b2f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Create a voice message",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1415,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e8db637f0274465d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Relay the message over the call",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1860,
			"y":860,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0ce206a21f41a05c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Vianix** — connects to existing CCTV/IP cameras and sends alerts through WhatsApp, SMS, email or dashboard, including a short video clip as evidence.\n\n**VIZO361 Fire Watch** — analyzes existing CCTV and can trigger alarms/PA/sprinkler systems and send WhatsApp alerts with screenshots.\n\n**3dEYE** — cloud-based AI fire/smoke detection from existing CCTV and describes faster emergency-service notification.\n\n**FireVision** — CCTV → AI analysis → instant notification with visual evidence.\n\n**viAct** — CCTV/IP camera fire and smoke analytics with automated escalation workflows and incident evidence.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1040,
			"y":1861,
			"width":540,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"e0f951a191c32457",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**“Emergency fire alert. This is an automated notification from the Fire Detection System.**\n\nA fire has been detected at **[BUILDING NAME]**, located at **[FULL ADDRESS]**.\n\nThe fire is detected on **[FLOOR NUMBER]**, in **[ROOM/AREA]**.\n\n**Estimated fire severity:** [LOW / MODERATE / HIGH / CRITICAL].  \n**Smoke detected:** [YES / NO].  \n**Estimated number of people inside:** [NUMBER / UNKNOWN].  \n**People potentially in immediate danger:** [NUMBER / UNKNOWN].\n\n**Detected fire location:** [SPECIFIC LOCATION].  \n**Building access:** [MAIN ENTRANCE / GATE / OTHER ACCESS INFORMATION].\n\nThe incident was detected at **[TIME]**.\n\n**Please dispatch a fire response team immediately.**\n\nThis is an automated emergency call. Please contact **[EMERGENCY CONTACT NAME]** at **[PHONE NUMBER]** for additional information.\n\n**I repeat: a fire has been detected at [BUILDING NAME], [ADDRESS]. Please dispatch emergency assistance immediately.”**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1765,
			"y":1000,
			"width":710,
			"height":460
		},
		{"id":"374f9b430c76655d","type":"text","text":"Find nearest fire department based on the location","x":-55,"y":1020,"width":280,"height":60}
	],
